@711 = ~Force Shield~
@712 = ~Force Shield (Evocation)
Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a force aura around the caster that deflects weapons and other dangerous objects. By cushioning their impact, it grants 5% + 1% per level physical damage resistance (maximum 25% at level 20).~
