Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 23 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates a force aura around the caster that deflects weapons and other dangerous objects. By cushioning their impact, it grants 25% resistance to physical damage.~
