@713 = ~Step Up~
@714 = ~Step Up (Enchantment)
Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the warlord to move faster without additional fatigue. His movement speed increases by 1 every 2 levels of the caster (maximum +6 at level 12). At level 12, this increased speed allows him to dodge more easily in combat, giving him a +1 bonus to AC.~
@7141 = ~Step Up (Enchantment)
