@7113 = ~Stop!~ //No icon
@7114 = ~Stop! (Evocation, Enchantment)
Level: 1
Range: 20 meters
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: negates

This spell strikes a creature directly, stopping it in its tracks. If it fails a save vs. spell, it is violently shaken for 2 seconds, which has the effect of stunning it for the current round, and imposes a -2 penalty to AC, THAC0 and saving throws. During the second round it regains its senses but still suffers the -2 penalty. During the third round the penalty becomes -1, after which the spell duration expires at the 4th round.
Every 5 levels of the caster, the save against this spell suffers an additional -1 penalty (maximum -4 at level 20).~

@7115 = ~Alternative Mastery~ //Icon to review
@7116 = ~Alternative Mastery (Alteration, Enchantment)
Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round / 2 levels
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell adapts the warlord's martial training to the limited range of weapons he uses while studying arcane magic.
By casting this spell, he becomes a specialist (2 proficiency points) in dagger or staff, depending on his choice during casting. He also becomes proficient in the associated fighting style (Single-Weapon Style for dagger, Two-Handed Weapon Style for staff).
With experience, the warlord improves this spell. He becomes an expert (3 proficiency points) in the weapon of his choice at level 7, and a specialist in the associated fighting style at level 10.~
